B.aGM=s(["Create and edit recipes and ingredients. Long-press an item to duplicate it.","Tap a recipe to expand or collapse its ingredients, method, and notes.","Recipe intake and manually logged food appear in the daily food list with their time and source.","Daily calorie and macro trends show calories separately from carbohydrate, protein, and sugar trends.","Open Summary in the Labyrinth drawer to export Calorie Intake or Quest Activity for a selected date range.","PDF reports use colorful, side-by-side Solo Leveling stat cards for player details and report totals.","Calorie Intake PDFs include your name, title, age, BMI, nutrition totals, and intake grouped by date.","Quest Activity PDFs include your name, title, level, quests cleared, HP and XP gained, then list each date with completed quests in rank - quest name format.","Shopping notes and monthly body-stat reminders are also available from Nutrition.","Monthly audit mail reminds you to review your body stats, but weight can be updated once per day from Status."],t.s)
B.b_s=new A.k2(B.q1,"NUTRITION","Recipes, ingredients, daily intake, and nutrition reports.",B.IL,B.aGM)
B.YC=new A.bv(62440,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aHV=s(["Create notes with a title and normal text, pin important notes, and remove notes you no longer need.","Start a line with * followed by a space to format it as a bullet; Enter continues the list, and Enter on an empty bullet exits it.","Notes are included in the device save and account sync."],t.s)
B.b_t=new A.k2(B.YC,"NOTES","A quick, private-feeling scratchpad in your player save.",B.aJ,B.aHV)
B.aHz=s(["Library is a saved-link archive for anything you want to revisit.","You can add links, search them, reorder entries, edit old records, and delete what you no longer need.","Opening a link uses the in-app viewer when possible, with a fallback to the browser.","It is meant for quick access to references, anime pages, tools, trackers, school links, work links, or guides."],t.s)
B.b_r=new A.k2(B.xo,"LIBRARY","A personal archive for links and resources.",B.aQ,B.aHz)
B.Ys=new A.bv(58475,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.aGy=s(["Theme lets you set separate background images for Labyrinth, Nutrition, Library, and Status.","A shared dim overlay keeps text and cards readable over custom images.","Images are compressed for storage and saved with this player profile.","Open Theme from the Labyrinth drawer to choose or remove an image for a tab."],t.s)
B.b_q=new A.k2(B.Ys,"THEME","Per-tab background images with account-bound cloud sync.",B.aJ,B.aGy)
