B.aGX=s(["Status shows your Monarch name, level, title, XP, HP, AP, stats, height, and weight.","XP comes from cleared quests. Leveling up increases your level, title progression, HP, and available AP.","AP can be used to upgrade your stats so progression feels tied to your choices.","Mass Progression Trend records weight history. You can update weight once per day unless you reset the trend.","History keeps records of progression, quest clears, rewards, weight updates, and food intake."],t.s)
B.b_v=new A.k2(B.xr,"STATUS","Your Monarch profile, level, stats, AP, HP, and mass trend.",B.aKH,B.aGX)
